root = Page("02 · Text — A question becomes a supported answer", LessonText("02 · Text — A question becomes a supported answer", ["Sam wants to understand why customer support volume increased. The assistant should clarify the scope, find relevant evidence, and show where each claim comes from.", "**A useful answer is traceable.** A fluent summary still needs sources, clear limitations, and a chance for Sam to correct the scope.", "This collection uses illustrative journeys, timings, budgets and outcomes. They are teaching examples, not measured product performance or customer research."]))
